he 5 V output): 5 V +-4 % (4.8-5.2 V), 150 kHz. Layout (v1 LEIA-ME 4): C10 / C11 at VIN, loop U1-D3-L2-C12 short.\nDisplay 5 V (review item 4): the CYD's own LDO needs ~4.4 V; through the SS34 it would get 4.3-4.5 V, so R6 0 ohm is fitted and D4 is DNP. D4 only with the JC3248W535; with R6 do not plug the display's USB while the fixture is powered.\nINA226: 50 mohm (R7 || R13), 81.92 mV full scale = 1.64 A; measures the sensor bus only (C-13). VS on +3.3V, not 3.3VA (review: its digital current stays off the analog rail). Kelvin: R7 / R13 side by side, sense from the pad centres.\n3.3VA = +3.3V through R9 10 ohm / C17 1 uF: ADS1115 x 3 and the NTC dividers (calc/checkone_budget.py)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 167.64 0) (size 157.48 27.94) (margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525) (stroke (width 0) (type solid) (color 204 102 0 1)) (fill (type none)) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "45e47fea-701e-5275-9a59-d4afb8b6920e")) (label "BUCK_SW" (at 86.36 34.925 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "df8c6301-ff90-5a7c-9763-b6c2080e81c5")) (label "5V_D" (at 53.34 90.805 270) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "d58d2c6f-1b1a-5c0a-8126-fbb9a005bf30")) (label "SDA" (at 182.245 109.22 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "d47f009d-ca07-598c-8c87-85529e816766")) (label "SCL" (at 182.245 111.76 180) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "e1b5d5e7-f042-5166-905c-ba3e5ee85e13")) (label "SDA" (at 111.76 160.655 90) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bcf00c9b-da15-5638-94b9-bee15a279665")) (label "SCL" (at 124.46 160.655 90) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b7fe4427-7095-5143-af22-c32b6eb9f2f4")) (label "SDA" (at 185.42 156.845 90) (fields_autop